                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, I spoke with more than 7,500 Virginians on my latest telephone town hall.\n\nFolks are angry \u2014 and rightfully so \u2014 about Trump\u2019s budget that will slash Medicaid and SNAP.\n\nI\u2019ll keep standing up for families and the programs that keep them afloat.",
