                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump's Big, Ugly Bill is cutting lifesaving programs \u2014 like SNAP and Medicaid \u2014 for millions of Americans.\n\nI am appalled that hardworking Americans are being treated as collateral damage as Trump cuts taxes for billionaires.",
