                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "FACT: Cruel GOP cuts to Medicaid will cost 300,000 Virginians their health care \u2014 including tens of thousands of residents of the Seventh District.\n\nI didn\u2019t come to Congress to sit idly by while the communities I serve lose access to care. I\u2019ll keep standing up for families because they deserve peace of mind.",
