                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I will support a budget bill that protects Virginians' healthcare, invests in public schools, and lowers costs for hardworking families.\n\u00a0\nThat is what the American people overwhelmingly want.\n\nI hope I get a chance to vote for that \u2014 but it certainly wasn\u2019t on the floor today. https://t.co/cJwdfblfDv",
