                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "What I want is a responsible budget that invests in our schools, lowers costs for families, and protects Virginians\u2019 healthcare.\n\nThe clock is ticking. I am ready and willing to support that kind of bill today. (2/3)",
