                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Virginia is home to tens of thousands of federal employees who keep our country running.\n\nIf Republicans force a shutdown, they shouldn\u2019t be left without support.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m backing @RepSarahElfreth's bill to extend unemployment insurance to those required to work during a shutdown.",
