                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Republicans\u2019 \u201cclean\u201d bill to reopen the government is anything but.\n\n\u274c There is nothing \u201cclean\u201d about a bill that strips billions from Medicaid and Medicare.\n\n\u274c There is nothing \u201cclean\u201d about a bill that takes meals away from students.\n\n\u274c There\u2019s nothing \u201cclean\u201d about a bill that allows President Trump to withhold funds for pediatric cancer research.\n\nThere is no such thing as a \u201cclean CR\u201d when this Administration has made clear that they put their own partisan politics over the people they serve.",
