                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As an ethics attorney, former U.S. Army JAG, and fighter for the Seventh District \u2013 I am a hell no on today\u2019s vote.\n\nThis budget is an insult to the American people. It does not address the healthcare affordability crisis, does not sufficiently protect federal workers, does not adequately support veterans affected by toxic burn pits, and does not stop the rampant chaos, cruelty, and unprecedented corruption from the rubber-stamp Republican party.",
